## Interface: 16001
## Title: Jimmy's Utils
## Notes: Adds a weighted stat score to item tooltips (and to the auction house list) using configurable per-stat coefficients, a target range check indicator (the spell icon, tinted red when out of range) for a spell you choose, a lookup of the recipes that use an item, a list of the characters you recently sent mail to next to the mailbox, and a window listing the recipes your mail has materials for. With Auctionator it also shows what each recipe earns when crafted and sold at the auction house.
## Author: Jimmy
## Version: 1.8
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\JimmysUtils\Media\MinimapIcon
## AddonCompartmentFunc: JimmysUtils_OnAddonCompartmentClick
## AddonCompartmentFuncOnEnter: JimmysUtils_OnAddonCompartmentEnter
## AddonCompartmentFuncOnLeave: JimmysUtils_OnAddonCompartmentLeave
## OptionalDeps: Auctionator
## SavedVariables: JimmysStatWeightsDB
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: JimmysStatWeightsCharDB

